# The re-decide step of step 12: a call planned and decided again when
# something that could change its answer happened after its decision
# (docs/architecture/03-agent-loop.md, "A call is decided again").
#
# Each rule is broken here: the round's count of changes and the policy's
# count of narrowings, the second decision itself, what it holds back, the
# order it keeps, and what the core's policy remembers of an answer.

[break] no-second-decision
rule: A call that has not started, decided before a change or a narrowing, is planned and decided again.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/round.rs
in: Round::pump
find: ) && self.is_stale(position, narrowed)
replace: ) && false
packages: cineris-agent, cineris-core
caught-by:
    redecide::a_write_through_a_link_an_earlier_call_made_is_planned_and_decided_again
    redecide::in_a_mixed_response_nothing_reaches_through_a_link_unjudged_whatever_the_order
    cineris-core::it redecide::sys_a_copy_through_a_link_an_earlier_command_made_is_asked_about_again
    cineris-core::it redecide::sys_a_write_through_a_link_an_earlier_command_made_is_planned_again_and_asked_about
    cineris-core::it redecide::sys_a_read_through_a_link_an_earlier_command_made_is_planned_again_and_asked_about

[break] changes-not-counted
rule: A call that ran and may have changed the file system counts, when it finishes.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/round.rs
in: Round::finished
find: self.changes += 1;
replace: self.changes += 0;
caught-by:
    redecide::a_write_through_a_link_an_earlier_call_made_is_planned_and_decided_again
    redecide::only_a_call_decided_before_a_call_with_side_effects_finished_is_decided_again

[break] every-call-counts
rule: A call that did not run, or that may change nothing, does not count: nothing is decided twice when nothing could change the answer.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/round.rs
in: Round::finished
find: if call.ran
replace: if true || call.ran
caught-by:
    redecide::a_command_found_to_only_read_does_not_make_a_second_decision
    redecide::a_call_that_waits_to_be_asked_is_decided_again_before_it_is_asked

[break] a-read-only-command-counts
rule: A command the policy found only reads does not count as a change.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/round.rs
in: Round::planned
find: footprint.may_change &= !only_reads;
replace:
caught-by:
    redecide::a_command_found_to_only_read_does_not_make_a_second_decision

[break] narrowing-ignored
rule: A call decided before the policy's rules narrowed is decided again.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/round.rs
in: Round::is_stale
find: changes: self.changes, narrowed
replace: changes: self.changes, narrowed: self.calls[position].decided.narrowed
packages: cineris-agent, cineris-core
caught-by:
    redecide::a_call_decided_before_a_rule_was_taken_back_is_decided_again
    cineris-core::it redecide::a_call_allowed_by_an_approval_revoked_while_it_waits_is_asked_about
    cineris-core::it redecide::a_call_decided_before_the_level_was_lowered_is_decided_again_and_refused
    cineris-core::it knowledge::sys_a_learned_command_turned_off_while_an_earlier_call_waits_is_asked_about

[break] no-wait-for-a-later-running-call
rule: A call decided again waits for a call it now conflicts with that is running, a later one too.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/round.rs
