replace: let waits_for_running = false && self.calls[position + 1..]
caught-by:
    redecide::a_command_no_longer_taken_as_read_only_waits_for_a_later_read_already_running

[break] no-wait-behind-a-call-still-to-be-decided-again
rule: While a call that may change the file system runs, and an answer may be a stop, a later call with side effects waits for every earlier call that has not started.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/round.rs
