in: EnginePolicy::ask_with
find: in_force.record(&question, &choice)
replace: in_force.get().record(&question, &choice)
caught-by:
    cineris-core::it redecide::a_revoke_made_while_the_level_changes_is_not_lost

[break] a-revoke-made-round-the-lock
rule: A revoke is made through the engine in force, under the lock a change of level holds.
file: crates/cineris-core/src/policy.rs
